sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser as Browser page components
    participant Hook as Browser upload hook
    participant Service as Browser API service
    box rgb(224,242,254) Frontend Docker container
        participant Frontend as NGINX :8080
    end
    box rgb(220,252,231) API Docker container - one Node process
        participant Bridge as Native server adapter :3000
        participant App as Fastify root application
        participant Upload as Scoped upload plugin
        participant Parser as Pure MPEG/Xing analyzer
    end
    User->>Browser: Select file
    Browser->>Hook: selectFile resets prior result
    User->>Browser: Analyze MP3
    Browser->>Hook: analyze on form submit
    alt Missing file or file exceeds 20 MiB
        Hook-->>Browser: Readable local error
        Browser-->>User: Display error
    else File passes local validation
        Hook->>Hook: Admit one request, set pending and start deadline
        Hook-->>Browser: Disable pending controls
        Hook->>Service: Await analysis of selected File with abort signal
        Service->>Frontend: Ky raw POST /file-upload?details=true#59; retries disabled
        alt Response is available
            alt Mapped NGINX upload/proxy failure
                Frontend-->>Service: 413, 502 or 504 status and JSON
            else Unmapped ingress response
                Frontend-->>Service: Status and body without a JSON guarantee
            else Request forwarded over HTTP/1.1 without buffering or retry
                Frontend->>Bridge: Forward raw bytes to api:3000 on Compose network
                alt Raw path, method or Expect refusal
                    Bridge-->>Frontend: Catalogue error#59; bounded rejection drain#59; HEAD body omitted
                else Exact accepted upload route
                    Bridge->>App: Dispatch into real Fastify handler
                    App->>Upload: Scoped onRequest admission
                    Upload->>Upload: Check headers, declared cap and capacity before allocation
                    alt Invalid headers, declared oversize or busy
                        Upload->>App: Reject with canonical catalogue projection
                        App-->>Frontend: Safe error#59; native unfinished body uses bounded drain
                    else Upload admitted
                        Upload->>Upload: Reserve slot#59; allocate one Buffer#59; start deadlines
                        Upload->>Upload: Custom content parser enforces actual bytes and completion
                        alt Limit, timeout, empty/incomplete body or client disconnect
                            Upload->>App: Settle parser failure and release once
                            App-->>Frontend: Canonical error when connected#59; disconnect may have no reply
                        else Complete nonempty body within 20 MiB
                            Upload->>Parser: Route invokes one complete boundary analysis
                            alt Valid supported file
                                Parser-->>Upload: Audio and physical counts#59; bounded carrier diagnostics
                                Upload->>Upload: Project allowed fields and validate aggregate invariants
                                Upload->>App: Serialize registered default or detailed success DTO
                                App-->>Frontend: 200 details JSON#59; default callers get frameCount only
                            else Invalid or unsupported structure
                                Parser-->>Upload: Typed domain failure
                                Upload->>App: Root error handler classifies to closed catalogue code
                                App-->>Frontend: 400 or 415 canonical JSON
                            end
                            Upload->>Upload: Handler finally releases buffer, timers and slot once
                        end
                    end
                end
                Note over App,Upload: Terminal response, abort and timeout hooks share idempotent release#59; unknown failures map to safe 500
                Frontend-->>Service: Forward received API status/body#59; disconnect may instead reject fetch
            end
            Service->>Service: Attempt to read response JSON
            alt JSON is readable
                Service->>Service: Interpret canonical success invariants or exact coded API error
                Service-->>Hook: Typed count or readable error
            else JSON is unreadable
                Service-->>Hook: Readable response parse error
            end
        else Fetch rejects, including abort
            Service--xHook: Propagate rejected fetch
            Hook->>Hook: Catch timeout or connection failure
        end
        alt Request generation is still current
            Hook-->>Browser: Render result and restore controls
            Browser-->>User: Count or readable error#59; allow retry
        else Superseded selection or unmounted page
            Hook->>Hook: Ignore stale outcome
        end
        Hook->>Hook: Finally clear deadline#59; clear active slot only if current
    end
    Note over Hook,Service: Selection and unmount abort requests#59; stale outcomes never update the page
    Note over Hook,App: Abort or network failure is not partial success
    Note over Upload,Parser: Recognized leading carrier adds one physical and zero audio frames#59; declarations never supply count
    Note over Upload,Parser: No MediaInfo, retained upload or background job
